# .gitignore for github.com/akshat3144/lok-sabha-study (repository root = this lok_sabha folder)
# Rule: publish code, codebook, derived statistics and labels. Never publish question or answer TEXT (copyright of the
# Lok Sabha Secretariat), credentials, model weights or large intermediate files.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Corpus text and everything that contains it (copyright: Lok Sabha Secretariat)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ is a whitelist: ignore everything, then re-include small files that hold no question or answer text.
data/*
!data/ref/
!data/coding/
!data/measures/

# reference data (parties, coalitions, ministries): keep the derived tables and the lookup code; drop raw downloads
data/ref/source/

# coding: keep codebook, samples and gold LABELS; drop sheets, adjudication files and coder notes (they contain text)
data/coding/*
!data/coding/codebook_frozen.json
!data/coding/codebook_v1.1_frozen.json
!data/coding/CODEBOOK_v1.1_frozen_snapshot.md
!data/coding/codebook_v1.1_frozen_snapshot.py
!data/coding/gold_labels.csv
!data/coding/gold_labels_pilot.csv
!data/coding/main_sample.csv
!data/coding/pilot_sample.csv
!data/coding/sample_meta.json

# measures: keep the public release and the sampling design; drop parquet (texts, prompts, model output, large files)
data/measures/*
!data/measures/release/
!data/measures/m2_sample.csv
!data/measures/m2_all_qids.csv
!data/measures/m2_batch1_qids.csv
!data/measures/m2_batch2_qids.csv
!data/measures/topic_terms.csv
!data/measures/topics_meta.json
!data/measures/m1_scores_calibration_m1_cos.json
!data/measures/m2_gold_alt_3.1fl_cost.json
!data/measures/m2_parity_cost.json

# GPU upload bundle and fine tuned models (contain corpus text / large weights)
jarvis_upload/
models/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Results: keep tables, figures and reports; drop bulky or row level intermediates
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/**/*.parquet
results/synthetic/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Credentials and secrets (none are in the tree today; keep it that way)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*.json
application_default_credentials.json
service-account*.json
*.p12

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Caches, logs, OS and editor files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.log
*.tmp
*.part

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
